{"type":"text","timestamp":1789825119579,"sessionID":"ses_f4628b113ffe9gyXGlLM5DZwK2","part":{"id":"prt_0b9e3d7c90011tN75lNLzI17Hk","sessionID":"ses_f4628b113ffe9gyXGlLM5DZwK2","messageID":"msg_0b9e36f29001IOG0PtDjKshEMT","type":"text","text":"I found several bugs in my draft script (source mapping order, missing formality/conditions values, a few row references). Let me rewrite it cleanly.","time":{"start":1789825112009,"end":1789825119579}}}
