ention'),\n (1197,1201,'the Transaction Committee authorized representatives of GHF, on behalf of','to confirm their continuing interest'),\n (1197,1201,'Mr. Noreck reported','in a possible transaction'),\n (1197,1201,'Subsequently, on April 21, 2016','another potential strategic buyer'),\n (1202,1208,'each potential buyer had been advised','May 10, 2016'),\n (1202,1208,'which deadline was subsequently postponed to May 19, 2016','most compelling offers'),\n (1209,1213,'Between May 19, 2016 and June 1, 2016','nine written indications of interest'),\n (1209,1213,'the Transaction Committee concluded that the two low bidders should be excluded','remaining seven potential buyers'),\n (1209,1213,'Between May 19, 2016 and June 1, 2016','equity values of $90 million to $134 million'),\n (1209,1213,'In view of the substantial amount of management time','additional due diligence'),\n (1209,1213,'given access to an internet data site','legal and financial due diligence'),\n (1209,1213,'the Transaction Committee concluded that the two low bidders should be excluded','from that'),\n (1214,1217,'In mid-June 2016','posted to the internet data site'),\n (1214,1217,'Potential buyers were instructed','financial terms of any non-cash proposal'),\n (1221,1226,'In early July 2016','not previously been part of the process'),\n (1221,1226,'After executing a confidentiality agreement','provided to the other potential buyers'),\n (1221,1226,'On July 12, 2016','equity value of $108 million'),\n (1221,1226,'Subsequently, Party C was provided access to the internet data site','by telephone on July 14, 2016'),\n (1227,1229,'In late July 2016, the Company received six LOIs','$19.20 to $24.00'),\n (1227,1229,'Party B, G&W and another bidder','voting agreement'),\n (1227,1229,'One bidder','with respect to those issues'),\n (1230,1231,'Party B submitted an LOI','expedited diligence review'),\n (1232,1235,'G&W submitted an LOI on July 21, 2016','South Quay property'),\n (1232,1235,'G&W also provided