.',\"\"\",\n    'R010 memo quote')\n\nrep(\"\"\"Inferred: identity (section 10.2): Party A is introduced in Q4 2015, named among the memorandum recipients, and never mentioned again; the first named continuing set without it is the six LOI submitters. Quotes: \\\\u201c' + q[0] + '\\\\u201d / \\\\u201c' + q[1] + '\\\\u201d',\"\"\",\n    \"\"\"Inferred: identity (section 10.2): Party A is introduced in Q4 2015, named among the memorandum recipients, and never mentioned again; the first named continuing set without it is the six LOI submitters: \\\\u201cIn late July 2016, the Company received six LOIs with offer prices per share ranging from $19.20 to $24.00\\\\u201d (P-012). Other quotes: \\\\u201c' + q[0] + '\\\\u201d / \\\\u201c' + q[1] + '\\\\u201d',\"\"\",\n    'R035 six-LOI quote')\n\nrep(\"\"\"    'Target decision (stated). Quotes: \\\\u201c' + q[0] + '\\\\u201d / \\\\u201c' + q[1] + '\\\\u201d / \\\\u201c' + q[2] + '\\\\u201d',\n    ['P-026', 'P-027', 'P-029'], 'Q6', df='2016-08-12', dt='2016-08-12', wa='2016-08-12',\"\"\",\n    \"\"\"    'Target decision (stated). Quotes: \\\\u201c' + q[0] + '\\\\u201d / \\\\u201c' + q[1] + '\\\\u201d / \\\\u201c' + q[2] + '\\\\u201d No-conflict confirmation: \\\\u201cBMO confirmed that it did not have any existing or contemplated material relationships with G&W in connection with the provision of any financial advisory or financing services to G&W\\\\u201d (P-027).',\n    ['P-026', 'P-027'], 'Q6', df='2016-08-12', dt='2016-08-12', wa='2016-08-12',\"\"\",\n    'R053 drop P-029, add quote')\n\nrep(\"\"\"qs = quotes(('P-028', 'the Company and G&W executed the merger agreement', 'executed the voting agreement'),\n                    ('X-023', 'shall mean $3,785,000', '$3,785,000'))\nadd('08/12/2016', 'PWRR, G&W and Pullman Acquisition Sub Inc.', 'Merger agreement signed', '3', None,\"\"\",\n    \"\"\"qs = quotes(('P-028', 'the Company and G&W executed the merger agreement', 'executed the voting agreement'),\n                    ('X-023', 'shall mean $3,785,000', '$3,785,000'),\n                    ('X-010', 'if the merger is not completed by December 31, 2016', 'by February 28, 2017'),\n                    ('P-026', 'termination fee equal to 3% of the transaction value in the case of G&W', 'negotiated down from 3.85%'),\n                    ('X-022', 'the absence of a financing condition in the merger agreement', 'as to its financial wherewithal'))\nadd('08/12/2016', 'PWRR, G&W and Pullman Acquisition Sub Inc.', 'Merger agreement signed', '3', None,\"\"\",\n    'R054 extra quotes')\n\nrep(\"\"\"    'Merger agreement signed (stated). Quotes: \\\\u201c' + qs[0] + '\\\\u201d / \\\\u201c' + qs[1] + '\\\\u201d Termination-fee and fiduciary-out terms were consequential for selection and are folded into this row (section 4).',\n    ['P-028', 'X-023', 'X-010', 'P-026'], 'Q8',\"\"\",\n    \"\"\"    'Merger agreement signed (stated). Quotes: \\\\u201c' + qs[0] + '\\\\u201d / \\\\u201c' + qs[1] + '\\\\u201d Fee history: \\\\u201c' + qs[3] + '\\\\u201d Outside date: \\\\u201c' + qs[2] + '\\\\u201d Financing condition: \\\\u201c' + qs[4] + '\\\\u201d Termination-fee and fiduciary-out terms were consequential for selection and are folded into this row (section 4).',\n    ['P-028', 'X-023', 'X-010', 'P-026', 'X-022'], 'Q8',\"\"\",\n    'R054 reason + src')\n\nrep(\"\"\"A bidder asked to improve and declining takes Would not improve earlier offer even though the target then chose the rival and Decided by is Target (section 10.3). No late-reconfirmation row\"\"\",\n    \"\"\"The target executed with G&W: \\\\u201cthe Company and G&W executed the merger agreement\\\\u201d (P-028). A bidder asked to improve and declining takes Would not improve earlier offer even though the target then chose the rival and Decided by is Target (section 10.3). No late-reconfirmation row\"\"\",\n    'R055 execution quote')\n\nrep(\"\"\"/ \\\\u201c' + q[1] + '\\\\u201d Party E was not displaced by exclusivity (none was executed),